2. Data Processing, Cloud Storage & International Transfer
OrxanAI is committed to maintaining strict data security and transparency regarding how and where user data is handled:

Primary Database & Authentication: Your profile information (email, hashed password, display name), conversation history, memory items, and user folders are securely transferred to and stored on Google Cloud Platform (GCP) and Firebase Firestore server clusters located in secured global data centers (including Europe and North America).
AI Model Processing: When you send prompts or multimedia inputs, your query and context are routed through secure API endpoints to Google Gemini, Google Lyria (music), Google Veo (video), and trusted inference partners (such as DeepInfra / HuggingFace for specialized LLM consultations).
Encryption in Transit & at Rest: All communications between your device and our servers are encrypted using modern Industry-standard TLS 1.3 / HTTPS encryption. Passwords are never stored in plain text and are cryptographically hashed.
Multi-Device Real-Time Syncing: Chat messages and settings are synchronized in real-time across your authenticated sessions and devices via secure websocket and server-sent stream protocols.
